            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Dictate Anywhere 2.12.18

- Fix additional cases of unwanted leading spaces and lowercase sentence starts in empty text fields.
- Reject stale cursor selections outside the active editor, including WebKit-based text fields.
- Preserve valid sentence and list context while preferring confirmed empty-field information over conflicting document text.
]]></description>
