            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Dictate Anywhere 2.12.17

- Fix unwanted leading spaces and lowercase sentence starts when dictating into an empty web text field.
- Let S1-mini clean up the original transcript, including filler words, without removing words before processing.
- Preserve cursor context for inserting text into existing sentences and lists.
]]></description>
