        <item>
            <title>2.12.16</title>
            <pubDate>Fri, 16 Oct 2026 10:07:03 -0400</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/hoomanaskari/mac-dictate-anywhere</link>
            <sparkle:version>58</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.12.16</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Dictate Anywhere 2.12.16

- Make live previews grow with your words instead of reserving an empty box, with Compact, Comfortable, and Large sizes.
- Restore the original overlay footprint in Compact mode and improve text readability, overflow fading, and waveform presentation.
- Choose a separate System, Light, or Dark theme for the overlay and replay a sample in settings.
- Improve settings contrast, focus indicators, spacing, and transcript history readability; add the standard Command-comma settings shortcut.
- Speed up local S1-mini transcript cleanup with verified transcript drafting while preserving the original input and cleanup safeguards.
- Reduce editor blocking and avoid duplicate paste retries, with safer numbered-list insertion and clipboard preservation.
]]></description>
